WEBVTT

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:21.430
<b>Muhyo & Roji's
Bureau of Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:48.650
Yes, nice! This is great!

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:50.250
Perfect for a test of courage!

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.420
There's no such thing as ghosts.

00:01:54.950 --> 00:01:57.960
Hello? Oh, Kenji-kun?

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:01.360
We're meeting up for our test of 
courage at Fumie's, tonight at seven.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:02.660
Don't be late.

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:05.270
<b>Oden</b>

00:02:03.310 --> 00:02:05.270
Piping Hot
 <b>Roasted Sweet Potatoes 
Now on Sale</b>

00:02:05.270 --> 00:02:07.280
I wonder if they're gonna show...

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:08.480
Brr, it's cold!

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:12.860
What the heck is this?

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:16.480
Ow...

00:02:16.480 --> 00:02:18.650
Hey, are you okay?

00:02:18.650 --> 00:02:20.530
Y-Yeah...

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:24.120
Got Questions About Spirits? Ask Us!
We Offer Consultations for Those Troubled by Spirits
The Muhyo Bureau of Supernatural Investigation 
Advertisement by: Kusano Jiro 

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:26.110
The Muhyo Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation?

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:27.620
<b>Muhyo Bureau of
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:02:26.110 --> 00:02:27.620
Yo, assistant!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:30.810
Hurry it up! I'm starving!

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:32.790
I'm making veggie stir-fry now.

00:02:33.050 --> 00:02:34.960
Meatless again?

00:02:34.960 --> 00:02:38.430
What do you expect? We haven't 
been getting any jobs at all.

00:02:38.430 --> 00:02:42.300
And just who's gonna respond to 
those vague flyers you made?

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:44.090
Oh, come on!

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:46.880
You think you're some big shot 
just 'cause you're an executor!

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:48.940
Hey, it's burning.

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:54.870
Our sign!

00:03:00.570 --> 00:03:04.330
<b>Article 2
Kenji and Nana</b>

00:03:04.770 --> 00:03:07.520
Muhyo, this kid's the one
 who broke our sign!

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.830
I'm not a kid!

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.780
My name's Kenji.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.840
An onion alien!

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.340
Onion!

00:03:17.440 --> 00:03:18.840
Sorry...

00:03:21.190 --> 00:03:22.550
So, Kenji or whatever.

00:03:23.020 --> 00:03:25.120
Why'd you break our sign?

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:29.030
Why do you think? Because 
it sounded really shady!

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:34.770
"Magical law" would mean your 
job is to punish ghosts, right?

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:38.560
But ghosts don't exist, so 
your whole job is a sham.

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.240
Oh, cool! <i>Jabin</i>!

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:41.550
Look...

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.490
Just leave this to me.

00:03:44.050 --> 00:03:47.680
Okay, so... Spirits, as you say,

00:03:47.680 --> 00:03:50.400
shouldn't actually exist in this world.

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:52.940
In addition to violating the laws of nature,

00:03:52.940 --> 00:03:54.820
they affect humans directly.

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:58.590
This doesn't mean all spirits are bad,

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:58.170
<b>Ghosts of the Dead</b>

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.000
<b>Evil Spirits</b>

00:03:58.170 --> 00:04:00.340
<b>Grudges</b>

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:02.040
but some cause accidents, possess people,

00:04:00.010 --> 00:04:02.260
<b>Possession</b>

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:04.510
or even murder people.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.260
<b>Murder</b>

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.590
<b>80,000 People Missing</b>

00:04:04.260 --> 00:04:06.470
<b>Magical Law</b>

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:07.320
And that's where magical law comes in.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:08.990
Each year, 80,000 people go missing. {fast}

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:10.360
A tenth are thought to be due to spirits. {fast}

00:04:10.360 --> 00:04:11.890
To stand and face these troubling times... {fast}

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:14.650
is what magical law is for!

00:04:15.700 --> 00:04:17.730
You <i>were</i> listening, weren't you?

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:20.300
Both of you!

00:04:19.190 --> 00:04:20.730
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:25.800
No matter what you say,
 I don't believe in spirits!

00:04:25.800 --> 00:04:29.320
My friends and I are doing a test of courage 
tonight at a shrine just outside town.

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:32.120
I'll prove that there's 
no such thing as ghosts!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:34.510
A shrine just outside town?

00:04:34.510 --> 00:04:36.960
Hey. You don't want to go there.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:40.170
Shut up, you shallot ghost!

00:04:41.440 --> 00:04:42.360
Lee—

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:46.200
Hey, that kid's pretty goo—

00:04:46.200 --> 00:04:49.100
Damn, that's one annoying brat.

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:51.720
I'm going to sleep.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:05.640
We're really going in?

00:05:05.640 --> 00:05:07.070
I'm scared...

00:05:07.070 --> 00:05:09.060
Don't worry.

00:05:11.200 --> 00:05:12.840
Hey, let's go back already.

00:05:12.840 --> 00:05:14.650
Something's gonna jump out at us!

00:05:14.650 --> 00:05:16.810
Nothing like that exists.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:21.230
I don't wanna do this!

00:05:21.230 --> 00:05:23.630
You think I'm stopping 
after we came this far?

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:25.720
I'm going in alone. Wait here.

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:26.940
Kenji!

00:05:26.940 --> 00:05:28.970
Don't leave us here!

00:05:35.330 --> 00:05:37.060
Don't scare me like that.

00:05:41.240 --> 00:05:45.350
I guess it <i>is</i> pretty creepy now
 that I see it in person...

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:50.310
But I don't believe in ghosts!

00:06:02.020 --> 00:06:03.980
I did it!

00:06:07.360 --> 00:06:08.760
Hey!

00:06:09.620 --> 00:06:10.640
Kenji!

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.620
You're okay?

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:15.270
That was nothing! Take a look!

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:19.020
What did I tell you? There's 
no such thing as ghosts!

00:06:22.470 --> 00:06:24.780
Gosh, that was scary.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.380
You're amazing, Kenji.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:28.280
It wasn't that big a deal.

00:06:28.900 --> 00:06:32.780
Huh? Kenji-kun, whose is that?

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:33.780
Huh?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:49.100
I've waited so long for this moment...

00:06:51.880 --> 00:06:55.350
For such young blood...

00:06:57.460 --> 00:06:58.100
Fumie!

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.780
Yoshio!

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.810
I declare Special Magical Law, Clause 82...

00:07:10.810 --> 00:07:13.110
Silver Armor!

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:26.860
Kenji! Are you okay?

00:07:28.370 --> 00:07:31.630
Yo. Was that the reward 
for your test of courage?

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:34.160
What is that thing?

00:07:34.160 --> 00:07:37.970
It's an evil spirit that drank the 
blood of 100 people long ago.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:41.610
It was so powerful, not even 
a shaman could get rid of it,

00:07:41.610 --> 00:07:43.230
so it was sealed in that shrine.

00:07:43.730 --> 00:07:46.480
And you removed the seal, Kenji.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:50.020
It must be absolutely famished...

00:07:51.740 --> 00:07:55.950
Yeah, but now that I'm here, 
its time of reckoning has come.

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:03.220
According to Magical Law Article 1212,

00:08:01.710 --> 00:08:05.920
<b>Crime: Mass Vampirism</b>

00:08:03.220 --> 00:08:05.740
for the crime of "Mass Vampirism,"

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:08.340
<b>Sentence: Imprisonment in Hell's Cell</b>

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:10.460
I sentence you to
 "Imprisonment in Hell's Cell"!

00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:24.700
Suffer just like all 
those people you killed,

00:08:24.700 --> 00:08:27.980
while you spend eternity in 
Hell regretting your sins.

00:08:28.680 --> 00:08:30.700
Curse you!

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:35.720
You will pay for this... one day!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:43.360
<b>Salonpos</b>

00:08:41.940 --> 00:08:43.370
Ow...

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:45.060
That should do it.

00:08:45.670 --> 00:08:47.840
I guess spirits really do exist.

00:08:47.840 --> 00:08:51.960
Well, I hope you've learned your lesson 
and won't be so careless again.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:55.930
Jeez... Give me a break.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.470
I know, okay? Here!

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.420
See ya!

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:05.480
What is it?

00:09:05.880 --> 00:09:06.840
Whoops...

00:09:07.350 --> 00:09:09.360
<b>Thanks, Onion and
 Bean Sprout</b>

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.880
Onions and bean sprouts are 
essential in veggie stir-fry.

00:09:12.880 --> 00:09:15.440
They're basically the married 
couple of food, you know?

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:18.400
Screw that! I'm meat!

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:20.240
I hate vegetables.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:25.230
<b>Muhyo Bureau of
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:23.140
Especially onions and bean sprouts!

00:09:27.520 --> 00:09:29.960
Why don't you eat your dinner, too?

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:32.970
Slow and steady wins the race, as they say.

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:34.720
Right, Yoichi?

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:38.440
We might not have the luxury 
of taking it slow and steady.

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:41.220
Who knows when there'll be movement again?

00:09:42.680 --> 00:09:43.900
Enchu...

00:09:47.160 --> 00:09:49.080
Yoichi is so persistent.

00:09:49.760 --> 00:09:53.980
If only Muhyo would take as 
much interest in me as he has.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:02.990
<b>Imprisonment in Hell's Cell</b>

00:10:00.490 --> 00:10:02.990
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:10:05.620 --> 00:10:09.000
<b>Bean Sprouts</b>

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:09.000
<b>Onion</b>

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.000
<b>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau of 
Supernatural Investigation</b>

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.880
Hey, you!

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:19.470
Help me, Onion and Bean Sprout!

00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:21.770
Give those back!

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:23.600
Look!

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:26.140
I told you not to come here again.

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:29.390
Aren't consultations about 
new incidents an exception?

00:10:29.790 --> 00:10:32.300
Yeah, that! I want a consultation!

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:34.990
Tell me if these are real 
ghost photos or not!

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:36.830
Stop it, Kenji!

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:40.410
This is Nana-nee. She wants 
to be a photographer.

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:44.490
She took all these pictures.

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:47.700
Can I have my pictures back?

00:10:48.660 --> 00:10:49.680
What do you think?

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:50.790
They're real, right?

00:10:50.790 --> 00:10:52.730
There's no mistaking it, right?

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:53.920
Really?

00:11:00.360 --> 00:11:02.490
See? They're ghost photos, right?

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:04.590
There's no such thing!

00:11:04.590 --> 00:11:05.770
Bingo.

00:11:06.850 --> 00:11:08.810
They're all real.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:13.810
And it's the same spirit in all of them.

00:11:14.250 --> 00:11:15.860
This one in particular...

00:11:16.760 --> 00:11:18.250
is pretty serious.

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:21.280
For real?

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.990
That's ridiculous.

00:11:22.990 --> 00:11:25.930
Something there just happened 
to look like a ghost.

00:11:25.930 --> 00:11:27.370
But...

00:11:27.760 --> 00:11:30.540
That's what the magical law book says, too.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:34.960
"Most are staged or a trick of the light.

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:35.670
However...

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:37.630
For certain reasons,

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:40.650
such as a sudden increase in density 
of spirit energy in an area,

00:11:40.650 --> 00:11:43.930
there are exceptions in which 
spirits take a physical form..."

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:46.180
Which means, once a spirit 
takes physical form,

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:49.060
it can be captured by a camera like yours.

00:11:49.650 --> 00:11:53.500
And you probably have the 
natural qualities of a medium.

00:11:54.920 --> 00:11:57.980
Spirit energy exists everywhere,

00:11:57.980 --> 00:12:01.260
but a certain type of person 
attracts it more than others.

00:12:05.240 --> 00:12:08.330
These qualities are genetic. 
It's in your blood.

00:12:08.640 --> 00:12:11.640
I bet everyone in your family 
saw these spirits, didn't they?

00:12:13.080 --> 00:12:14.580
Shut up!

00:12:14.580 --> 00:12:17.930
Everyone in my family is already gone!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:23.080
That wasn't good, Onion.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:25.260
Nana-nee's family has been through a lot.

00:12:25.730 --> 00:12:29.660
Her dad was a pretty accomplished 
photographer, but...

00:12:38.130 --> 00:12:40.360
Nana, this is for you.

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:43.500
A camewa!

00:12:44.360 --> 00:12:46.620
You can take pictures of whatever you want.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:48.120
Everything is yours now, Nana.

00:12:48.590 --> 00:12:49.950
Everything?

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:51.280
Everything.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:52.120
Even you?

00:12:52.550 --> 00:12:55.120
That's right. Even me!

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.090
Hup!

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.740
Hurry! Hurry!

00:13:03.940 --> 00:13:05.260
Oh, Nana.

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:06.330
Ouch...

00:13:06.330 --> 00:13:07.430
Come on.

00:13:07.910 --> 00:13:08.950
Nana.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:12.020
Daddy!

00:13:21.110 --> 00:13:24.410
Just stop taking pictures. It's pathetic.

00:13:24.410 --> 00:13:25.900
But, honey...

00:13:25.900 --> 00:13:27.130
Goodbye.

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:28.860
Mommy...

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:32.870
Yes, I'm all right now.

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:35.680
Yes, I can get back to work...

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.740
Ah... Hello?

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.540
Nana...

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:46.220
Daddy, are you okay?

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:47.850
Nana...

00:13:48.480 --> 00:13:50.700
I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.

00:13:57.430 --> 00:13:58.490
Dad!

00:13:59.060 --> 00:14:01.440
I did it! I got a scoop!

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:04.690
The moment a bank robber was 
apprehended at the station!

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:07.200
We can sell this and make big money!

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.710
Wha... Dad?

00:14:09.880 --> 00:14:13.960
How could you put yourself in such 
danger? I'm disappointed in you!

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:17.020
I'm the one who's disappointed!

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:18.870
What kind of stupid job is this?!

00:14:19.210 --> 00:14:22.380
All you do is fabricate 
ghost photos in secret!

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:25.630
It's keeping dinner on the table, isn't it?

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:28.800
You being so stingy is exactly the problem!

00:14:28.800 --> 00:14:30.640
Get out and challenge yourself again!

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:32.670
It's not like that, Nana!

00:14:32.670 --> 00:14:34.750
Once I finish this, I'll get a real job—

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:36.600
That's always your excuse!

00:14:37.010 --> 00:14:38.640
The way you are...

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.900
It's no wonder Mom left you!

00:14:47.960 --> 00:14:49.670
You're awful.

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:52.150
I was just trying to help...

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:54.050
Nana...

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.120
You...

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:57.130
useless father!

00:14:58.220 --> 00:14:59.080
Nana!

00:14:59.410 --> 00:15:00.580
Nana!

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:08.130
Nana...

00:15:15.090 --> 00:15:16.940
Why did I do that?

00:15:20.000 --> 00:15:20.900
Huh?

00:15:22.690 --> 00:15:24.230
When did this...

00:15:41.240 --> 00:15:43.450
N-No...

00:15:44.380 --> 00:15:46.010
Nana-nee!

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:47.290
I knew it.

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:48.340
Muhyo!

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:52.220
According to Magical Law Article 383,

00:15:51.220 --> 00:15:55.470
<b>Crimes: Unlawful Entry to a Residence 
and Attempted Bodily Harm</b>

00:15:52.220 --> 00:15:56.310
for the crimes of "Unlawful Entry to a 
Residence" and "Attempted Bodily Harm,"

00:15:56.720 --> 00:16:00.230
I sentence you to "Hell's Iron Soldiers"!

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.140
<b>Sentence: Hell's Iron Soldiers</b>

00:16:23.410 --> 00:16:24.460
Muhyo!

00:16:39.940 --> 00:16:41.220
Stop!

00:16:41.220 --> 00:16:45.580
That shelf is full of my 
memories with my dad!

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:54.530
Nana-chan!

00:17:09.940 --> 00:17:10.660
Da...

00:17:11.510 --> 00:17:12.560
Daddy?

00:17:14.580 --> 00:17:15.800
Daddy...

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:17.070
Huh?

00:17:17.070 --> 00:17:18.060
She just...

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:20.440
Muhyo!

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:22.240
That was a big mistake.

00:17:22.240 --> 00:17:24.170
I accused him of the wrong crime.

00:17:24.170 --> 00:17:26.190
That's why the magical 
law turned back on you?

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:36.270
It's the rule of magical law that 
if the punishment is wrong,

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:38.030
the executor takes the punishment.

00:17:38.480 --> 00:17:42.040
His crime was simple "Unsolicited 
Posterior Appearance."

00:17:42.740 --> 00:17:44.840
At first glance, I sensed hostility

00:17:44.840 --> 00:17:48.110
in the hand showing up in 
these photos, but I was wrong.

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:51.640
It was really just a cry for attention.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:53.770
Must be pretty painful

00:17:53.770 --> 00:17:57.800
when your own daughter 
doesn't realize you're there.

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.890
That's Nana-nee's dad?

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:01.810
It can't be him.

00:18:02.260 --> 00:18:05.450
I saw him dead with my own eyes.

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:09.440
I looked at his face over and 
over, but he didn't move.

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:12.400
Please, tell me it's not true!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:15.580
If it's my dad, why did 
he attack me? Tell me!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:18.920
He couldn't go to Heaven in peace?

00:18:20.210 --> 00:18:22.200
Because he hit me?

00:18:22.850 --> 00:18:24.950
In that case, I was...

00:18:25.450 --> 00:18:27.210
You useless father!

00:18:29.650 --> 00:18:31.450
It's too cruel...

00:18:32.020 --> 00:18:34.710
He never attacked you.

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:40.040
He probably acted out because he thought 
my magical law might hurt you.

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:43.970
Spirits generally have a very
 muddled consciousness,

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:48.490
but they have this annoying way of 
remembering the important stuff perfectly.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:49.980
He... re...

00:18:51.650 --> 00:18:53.150
<b>I Love Daddy</b>

00:18:58.660 --> 00:18:59.740
Daddy...

00:19:03.760 --> 00:19:04.740
Daddy!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:08.250
Daddy!

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:13.750
I wanted to make up with you!

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.250
<b>I Love Daddy</b>

00:19:13.750 --> 00:19:16.250
<b>Nana's first photo!!</b>

00:19:14.030 --> 00:19:16.250
Daddy!

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:19.510
Na... na...

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:21.260
That's enough.

00:19:21.640 --> 00:19:22.520
Huh?

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:23.600
Hey...

00:19:23.600 --> 00:19:26.430
I told you the spirit's consciousness 
is muddled, didn't I?

00:19:26.430 --> 00:19:28.850
We can't have it acting out again.

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:30.020
No!

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:34.840
According to Magical Law Article 701,

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:38.400
<b>Crime: Unsolicited Posterior Appearance</b>

00:19:35.260 --> 00:19:38.120
for the crime of "Unsolicited 
Posterior Appearance,"

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.570
<b>Sentence: Crossing the Styx</b>

00:19:39.100 --> 00:19:42.660
I sentence you to "Crossing the Styx"!

00:19:46.640 --> 00:19:49.370
I think you've got the wrong idea here.

00:19:49.370 --> 00:19:52.620
Did you think turning into a ghost 
out of concern for your daughter

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:55.590
would allow you to escape your crime?

00:19:57.280 --> 00:19:59.040
Sit on that ferry,

00:19:59.040 --> 00:20:01.630
and think long and hard 
about what you've done.

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:03.480
No! Daddy!

00:20:03.840 --> 00:20:04.940
Daddy!

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:06.600
Nana!

00:20:08.650 --> 00:20:10.160
That was terrible!

00:20:10.160 --> 00:20:12.320
How could you send Nana-chan's dad to Hell?!

00:20:12.320 --> 00:20:13.140
Unforgivable!

00:20:13.140 --> 00:20:16.780
You moron! Don't you know 
what "Crossing the Styx" is?

00:20:16.780 --> 00:20:18.780
Get your hand off of me or you're fired!

00:20:18.780 --> 00:20:19.860
Huh?

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:24.490
Daddy... Will you forgive me?

00:20:28.340 --> 00:20:31.820
Nana, you're a very good girl.

00:20:32.400 --> 00:20:34.740
Thank you, Daddy.

00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:37.600
Nana...

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:45.520
"'Crossing the Styx' is a punishment 
given to spirits guilty of minor crimes.

00:20:45.520 --> 00:20:48.600
Once they atone for their crimes in the 
Underworld, they can go to Heaven."

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.010
That means...

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:51.120
Yeah!

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:53.940
Your dad will be able to 
go to Heaven, Nana-chan!

00:20:53.940 --> 00:20:55.940
All right!

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.480
Muhyo!

00:20:57.480 --> 00:20:58.960
That's our Onion!

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:00.430
Shut up!

00:21:00.430 --> 00:21:02.440
Why the hell are you here?!

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:05.200
An onion would be lonely with 
nothing but bean sprouts, right?

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:09.580
Hey... Can you prove that 
my dad went to Heaven?

00:21:09.580 --> 00:21:10.600
Huh?

00:21:10.600 --> 00:21:13.900
I'm going to follow you 
until I can believe it!

00:21:16.660 --> 00:21:17.960
Idiot.

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:52.050
Let's learn about magical law!

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:52.050
(with video)

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:52.050
<b>Kusano Jiro 
"I put together some of the classic types of spirits!"</b>

00:22:49.550 --> 00:22:52.050
Subscribe

00:22:52.350 --> 00:22:54.540
Welcome to LawTube!

00:22:56.150 --> 00:22:58.250
<i>Jabin</i> is so great!

00:23:00.210 --> 00:23:04.470
Now, let's study some different 
types of spirits today.

00:23:04.270 --> 00:23:19.330
Bound Spirits   Vengeful Spirits   
Animal Spirits   Wandering Spirits

00:23:04.470 --> 00:23:06.600
There are various types of spirits.

00:23:06.600 --> 00:23:09.720
There are wandering spirits, animal 
spirit, vengeful spirits, and—

00:23:10.470 --> 00:23:13.880
Uh, and the most troublesome 
ones are the bound spirits.

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:17.040
This manga is the best!

00:23:14.880 --> 00:23:17.040
When a bound spirit appears,

00:23:17.040 --> 00:23:19.930
it's always surrounded by 
thick ectoplasm, like thi—

00:23:19.930 --> 00:23:20.860
Wait, what?!

00:23:20.860 --> 00:23:23.130
Oh, no! It's a bound spirit!

00:23:23.130 --> 00:23:26.460
Muhyo, help!

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:25.940
Whoa, what is this?!

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:29.970
<b>Bound Spirit</b>

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:29.970
Roji...

00:23:28.670 --> 00:23:29.970
My poor fish...

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:32.780
No matter how jealous you are,

00:23:32.780 --> 00:23:34.550
no matter how hard you try,

00:23:34.550 --> 00:23:39.270
there's nothing genius about you, 
and I'm going to make you see that.

00:23:40.560 --> 00:23:44.230
Next time on <i>Muhyo & Roji's Bureau 
of Supernatural Investigation</i>,

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:46.010
Article 3:

00:23:46.480 --> 00:23:47.400
"Talent."

00:23:47.920 --> 00:23:50.620
Magical law will be enforced.

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:54.950
<b>Article 3 
Talent</b>
